{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:07726f4ce574f6b14db934d432c40c3bf6c103ad0e93e18f787a86c3b74f26dc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28e660e51e0d4c099b0bbdf2b16c63759482c7fccc10e78c3172308d7d55f67f",
      "text": "喂喂……制作人，晚上好。\n今天真的非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d84c9d2b65828519d29a6fab201d0aae0d965fb36c275b28e419bb337c1d64cc",
      "text": "无论是帮我们准备蛋糕，还是把将棋俱乐部的事\n告诉花音君他们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:029cd55fd42ee12f9ff2533466f4a1d32e89f848020e467fb2d5356bec5bae87",
      "text": "两个人也说了，要是没有制作人在的话，\n“大作战”就不会成功了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fe8a48163e8d9ed2a3fecffca7d37bbd09d7dd1546bda9a89c78d19761d553c",
      "text": "……呵呵。啊，那个，突然笑出来对不起……！\n我只是回想起了今天开心的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edfef876e822a6476f106013cb1038f648d86fe3fb88f4f3b9009405ae047edb",
      "text": "他们两个人特意跑去将棋俱乐部，调查怎么才能和我一起玩，我真的非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bc4acb10b14ba6b2e287dfd58eb67d320cb9a03bdba216e17b0e4a6add3552c",
      "text": "因为我之前心里也稍微想过，要是能通过将棋\n和大家一起玩就好了呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01763f736472768dd273180e8966a624afb8efbba3b619f7b55531aa5ec8dc50",
      "text": "下次再一起\n下将棋吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e74b03014da3d39f2772a4447c2c29480412f8268595f0254e9edf7bd6406d9b",
      "text": "能玩得开心\n比什么都强",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e7a1da95fbc486900fc258916e65867a947339c4712bd03719e8753373d16d5",
      "text": "嗯！花音君和志狼君\n也对我这么说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb98e0ad3bb54284e289a7b72ab9756ab79204fb0c8a8be4dc637e208b0d213",
      "text": "这成了我一次非常美好的生日回忆。\n对于大家，我由衷地心怀感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef834231564aa278dcaee9383aedd7bfc8134c6d6ac015ba58d5049544dd8f22",
      "text": "啊，我也正打算接下来\n给他们两个人打通电话道谢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_22_t01:1_2_032_22_t01:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706df4ffc4ebc778b170185d3299cebc72d60fd50f8c2579d529d3aa9ba0923c",
      "text": "那么，制作人，\n今后也请多多关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
